{"seq":1,"slug":"transit-sla-achievement","title":"时效达成与 SLA 指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-kpi-system/transit-sla-achievement","wordCount":2029,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"时效达成与-sla-指标\">时效达成与 SLA 指标</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时效是承运商绩效里权重最高、争议也最大的一类指标。争议的根源不在计算本身，而在**&quot;达成&quot;这个词没有唯一定义**。同一批 1000 票货，按承诺自然日算达成率是 91.2%，按工作日算变成 94.8%，把揽收延迟的票剔除后变成 96.1%。三个数字都&quot;正确&quot;，因为它们算的是三件不同的事。承运商谈判时挑选对自己有利的口径，是绩效体系最常见的失血点。</p>\n<p>要堵住这个缺口，必须在指标层固定三件事：<strong>时钟从哪里开始、终点如何判定、分母包含哪些票</strong>。这三件事一旦固定，达成率就变成一个可复现、可审计、可跨期比较的确定量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[下单/揽收指令] --&gt; B[揽收完成&lt;br/&gt;first_mile_pickup]&#10;  B --&gt; C[出口清关&lt;br/&gt;export_cleared]&#10;  C --&gt; D[干线在途&lt;br/&gt;linehaul]&#10;  D --&gt; E[进口清关&lt;br/&gt;import_cleared]&#10;  E --&gt; F[末端派送&lt;br/&gt;last_mile_delivered]&#10;  B -.-&gt;|承诺窗口起点| G{SLA 计时器}&#10;  F -.-&gt;|承诺窗口终点| G&#10;  C -.-&gt; H[分段归因]&#10;  D -.-&gt; H&#10;  E -.-&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[责任方: 出口清关行/干线承运商/末端商]\">graph TD\n  A[下单/揽收指令] --&gt; B[揽收完成&lt;br/&gt;first_mile_pickup]\n  B --&gt; C[出口清关&lt;br/&gt;export_cleared]\n  C --&gt; D[干线在途&lt;br/&gt;linehaul]\n  D --&gt; E[进口清关&lt;br/&gt;import_cleared]\n  E --&gt; F[末端派送&lt;br/&gt;last_mile_delivered]\n  B -.-&gt;|承诺窗口起点| G{SLA 计时器}\n  F -.-&gt;|承诺窗口终点| G\n  C -.-&gt; H[分段归因]\n  D -.-&gt; H\n  E -.-&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[责任方: 出口清关行/干线承运商/末端商]</pre><p>跨境链路把时效拆成了至少五段。整段时效达标但其中某一段严重拖后，说明问题被其他环节的余量掩盖了；整段超时也必须能定位到具体是哪一段贡献了超时。<strong>只看端到端达成率的绩效体系无法指导改进</strong>，因为它不告诉你该找谁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺时效的定义与三种口径陷阱\">承诺时效的定义与三种口径陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"口径陷阱一-自然日还是工作日\">口径陷阱一：自然日还是工作日</h3><p>承诺&quot;5 日达&quot;时，&quot;5&quot;的计量单位必须先定义。自然日（calendar day）包含周末与当地节假日；工作日（business day）不包含。跨境场景下两者差异巨大：一条 5 自然日的承诺，如果跨越一个当地的连续假期，工作日口径下可能只剩 2 天。ISO 8601 用持续时间表达这两类语义时是分开的——<code>P5D</code> 表示 5 个自然日，而工作日语义在标准中并没有直接的等价表示（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601\">ISO 8601 日期与时间格式</a>）。工程上正确的做法是：<strong>存储时统一存绝对时间点，只在下单时把承诺转换为一个绝对截止时刻</strong>，避免在计算阶段再做自然日/工作日换算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"口径陷阱二-时区必须内联\">口径陷阱二：时区必须内联</h3><p>跨时区链路里&quot;第 5 天到达&quot;在字面上可以对应多个绝对时刻。解决办法是强制所有事件时间戳携带时区偏移。RFC 3339 对此的要求是明确的：时间戳必须是&quot;某个时间点的无歧义表示&quot;，因此必须完整限定，<code>Z</code> 表示 UTC，<code>+08:00</code> 这类数值偏移表示本地时间减 UTC，而未限定的本地时间不可接受（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3339\">RFC 3339: Date and Time on the Internet</a>）。这条规则在绩效系统里的实际含义是：数据库里不允许出现不带偏移的 <code>timestamp</code> 字段，任何&quot;当地时间&quot;都必须在写入时立即转成 UTC 绝对时刻。</p>\n<h3 id=\"口径陷阱三-承诺起点\">口径陷阱三：承诺起点</h3><p>起点有三种常见选择：下单时刻、承运商揽收时刻、以及出口清关放行时刻。三者的差别在于<strong>风险归属</strong>——揽收延迟是承运商的问题还是发货人的问题。把起点定在下单时刻会惩罚承运商无法控制的部分；定在揽收时刻则把揽收前的时间从考核中排除。合理的做法是双起点：对承运商考核揽收起点，对整体履约考核下单起点，两套指标并存但分别归属不同的责任方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"达成率的计算口径与分母界定\">达成率的计算口径与分母界定</h2><p>达成率的分子是&quot;在承诺截止时刻前完成终态事件&quot;的票数，分母则是争议最大的部分。以下四类票必须显式决定是否入分母：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>票的类型</th>\n<th>是否入分母</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常完成且在窗口内</td>\n<td>是（分子）</td>\n<td>基准情形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常完成但超窗</td>\n<td>是（不在分子）</td>\n<td>真实失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户主动改约/取消</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>失败不由承运商造成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商如实上报的不可抗力</td>\n<td>否，但单独统计</td>\n<td>剔除会掩盖问题，不剔除会误判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商主动申报丢失</td>\n<td>是（不在分子）</td>\n<td>丢失即失败，不能通过&quot;退出分母&quot;洗掉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据缺失无法判定</td>\n<td>单列，不入分母</td>\n<td>混入任一侧都会污染指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行是设计要点。<strong>丢失票绝不能从分母中移除</strong>——否则承运商的最优策略是尽早申报丢失以提升达成率。数据缺失率则应作为独立指标单独盯，这属于<a href=\"damage-loss-tracking-quality\">轨迹质量指标</a>的范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 时效达成率：双起点 + 显式分母界定&#10;WITH shipments AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    s.shipment_id,&#10;    s.carrier_id,&#10;    s.lane_id,&#10;    s.pickup_at_utc                       AS start_utc,&#10;    s.promised_deadline_utc               AS deadline_utc,&#10;    d.delivered_at_utc                    AS end_utc,&#10;    COALESCE(d.delivered_at_utc, s.lost_at_utc) AS terminal_utc,&#10;    CASE&#10;      WHEN s.cancelled_by_buyer       THEN &#39;excluded_buyer&#39;&#10;      WHEN s.force_majeure_claimed    THEN &#39;excluded_fm&#39;&#10;      WHEN d.delivered_at_utc IS NULL&#10;           AND s.lost_at_utc IS NULL  THEN &#39;undetermined&#39;&#10;      ELSE &#39;counted&#39;&#10;    END                                   AS denom_bucket,&#10;    CASE WHEN COALESCE(d.delivered_at_utc, s.lost_at_utc) &lt;= s.promised_deadline_utc&#10;         THEN 1 ELSE 0 END                AS on_time&#10;  FROM shipment_milestone s&#10;  LEFT JOIN shipment_delivery d USING (shipment_id)&#10;  WHERE s.pickup_at_utc &gt;= :window_start&#10;    AND s.pickup_at_utc &lt;  :window_end&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  carrier_id, lane_id,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE denom_bucket = &#39;counted&#39;)              AS denom,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE denom_bucket = &#39;counted&#39;&#10;                     AND on_time = 1)                           AS numerator,&#10;  ROUND(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE denom_bucket = &#39;counted&#39; AND on_time = 1)::numeric&#10;        / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE denom_bucket = &#39;counted&#39;), 0), 4)&#10;                                                                AS otd_rate,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE denom_bucket = &#39;undetermined&#39;)::numeric&#10;    / NULLIF(COUNT(*), 0)                                       AS undetermined_rate&#10;FROM shipments&#10;GROUP BY carrier_id, lane_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 时效达成率：双起点 + 显式分母界定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipments </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lane_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pickup_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                       AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start_utc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promised_deadline_utc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deadline_utc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delivered_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> end_utc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delivered_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lost_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terminal_utc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cancelled_by_buyer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'excluded_buyer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">force_majeure_claimed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'excluded_fm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delivered_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lost_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'undetermined'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'counted'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                   AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delivered_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lost_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">promised_deadline_utc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_milestone s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_delivery d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (shipment_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pickup_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :window_start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pickup_at_utc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  :window_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_id, lane_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom_bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'counted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom_bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'counted'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     AND</span><span style=\"color:#2