n style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom_bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'counted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                                AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otd_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom_bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'undetermined'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> undetermined_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_id, lane_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询里有三个刻意的设计。<code>denom_bucket</code> 把剔除规则显式化，审计时能看到每类票被剔了多少，而不是只有一个最终比值。<code>undetermined_rate</code> 单独输出，因为它衡量的是数据质量而非承运商表现。<code>COALESCE(delivered, lost)</code> 让丢失票留在分母里，堵住&quot;申报丢失以提升达成率&quot;的漏洞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分段归因-超时该算谁的\">分段归因：超时该算谁的</h2><p>端到端达成率是最终指标，但改进必须落到段上。分段归因的做法是给每一段设一个<strong>段内承诺时长</strong>，段的实际时长超过承诺时长时记为段超时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected &#x27;EOF&#x27;, got &#x27;_&#x27; at position 10: \\text{seg_̲overrun}\\_k = \\…\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\text{seg_overrun}\\_k = \\max\\left(0,\\; (t_k^{end} - t_k^{start}) - d_k^{promised}\\right)</span></div><p>整段超时不一定等于各段超时之和——上游提前完成可以补偿下游的延迟。因此归因需要决定是<strong>绝对超时</strong>还是<strong>贡献超时</strong>。绝对超时只标记真正超标的段，用于责任判定；贡献超时按各段相对承诺的偏离量分配总超时，用于改进优先级排序。两者用途不同，不能只算一个。</p>\n<p>分段归因能成立的隐含前提是各段边界事件可靠——这正是为什么轨迹事件质量必须先于时效指标建设，见<a href=\"damage-loss-tracking-quality\">破损丢件与轨迹质量指标</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小样本下不要用点估计\">小样本下不要用点估计</h2><p>冷门线路的样本量经常只有十几票。用 12 票算出 91.7% 的达成率，然后与其他线路的达成率排名，是绩效体系最常见的统计错误：12 票里错 1 票与 5000 票里错 1 票，被赋予同样的权重。</p>\n<p>解决办法是在指标层就输出区间而非点估计。二项比例的 Wilson 区间对 <code>$n$</code> 很小或 <code>$\\hat p$</code> 接近 0/1 的情形表现稳定，不会像正态近似那样产生越界或零宽区间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>±</mo><mi>z</mi><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\hat p + \\frac{z^2}{2n} \\pm z\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat p(1-\\hat p)}{n} + \\frac{z^2}{4n^2}}}{1 + \\frac{z^2}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3814em;vertical-align:-1.1514em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.23em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5111em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3175em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9164em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mti