t\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2775em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5225em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1514em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>$\\hat p$</code> 是观测达成率，<code>$z$</code> 是置信水平对应的标准正态分位数，95% 置信度取 <code>$z = 1.96$</code>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Binomial_proportion_confidence_interval\">二项比例置信区间</a>）。区间保留在 <code>$[0,1]$</code> 内，且在 <code>$\\hat p$</code> 接近边界时仍给出有意义的宽度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Wilson 区间下界：用于小样本线路的保守排名&#10;def wilson_lower(success, n, z=1.96):&#10;    if n == 0:&#10;        return None&#10;    p = success / n&#10;    denom = 1 + z * z / n&#10;    centre = p + z * z / (2 * n)&#10;    margin = z * ((p * (1 - p) / n + z * z / (4 * n * n)) ** 0.5)&#10;    return (centre - margin) / denom\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Wilson 区间下界：用于小样本线路的保守排名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wilson_lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(success, n, z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.96</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    denom </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    centre </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    margin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (centre </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> margin) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实操上，绩效系统通常同时输出两个口径：点估计用于看板展示（运营人员习惯看单值），<strong>区间下界用于排名与分级</strong>（避免小样本线路因为运气好而获得高等级）。这一条与第二章的<a href=\"../scorecard-grading/carrier-scorecard-model\">承运商记分卡模型</a>直接衔接，因为区间下界是记分卡的输入之一。至于跨线路的达成率差异是否真的显著，以及不同市场基础设施带来的系统性偏差如何处理，见<a href=\"../scorecard-grading/lane-market-benchmark\">线路/市场绩效对标</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时效指标必须先固定三件事：时钟起点、终点判定、分母界定；不固定则达成率不可比。</li>\n<li>自然日与工作日是两种语义，承诺应在下单时转换为绝对截止时刻，计算阶段不再做单位换算。</li>\n<li>所有事件时间戳必须携带时区偏移，未限定的本地时间不可接受；RFC 3339 是通用基线。</li>\n<li>丢失票必须留在分母内，否则承运商会通过申报丢失来提升达成率。</li>\n<li>数据缺失率是独立指标，不能混入达成率的任一侧。</li>\n<li>分段归因要区分绝对超时（责任判定）与贡献超时（改进排序），两者不可互相替代。</li>\n<li>小样本线路用 Wilson 区间下界参与排名，点估计只用于展示。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时效达成与 SLA 指标","id":"时效达成与-sla-指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺时效的定义与三种口径陷阱","id":"承诺时效的定义与三种口径陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"口径陷阱一：自然日还是工作日","id":"口径陷阱一-自然日还是工作日"},{"level":3,"text":"口径陷阱二：时区必须内联","id":"口径陷阱二-时区必须内联"},{"level":3,"text":"口径陷阱三：承诺起点","id":"口径陷阱三-承诺起点"},{"level":2,"text":"达成率的计算口径与分母界定","id":"达成率的计算口径与分母界定"},{"level":2,"text":"分段归因：超时该算谁的","id":"分段归因-超时该算谁的"},{"level":2,"text":"小样本下不要用点估计","id":"小样本下不要用点估计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"破损丢件与轨迹质量指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-kpi-system/damage-loss-tracking-quality"}}